    @section openldap_installation Installation Notes

    If you intend to use the <i>oracle</i> module along with <i>openldap</i>
    on Linux, you will probably encounter
    <a href="https://github.com/qorelanguage/qore/issues/1043">issue 1043</a>.
    There is currently no generic solution, but a @c LD_PRELOAD work-around
    is available.

